      <activity id="7961aa75-1dd5-5da2-af77-522ac147c29c" activityNameId="5ea02a28-747c-5c35-a187-7a6b294e20ad" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Granite, natural stone council, crushed, for mill</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Granite, natural stone council, crushed, for mill
This dataset reflects granite crushing and is based on North American inventory data for granite processing. The energy use is taken from the ecoinvent dataset "limestone, crushed, for mill" and scaled based on the ratio of energy consumption for granite and limestone processing reported by the natural stone council.;
UUID: 8394f00e-b021-36ce-9b50-56a635b6ab8d
This dataset includes the material and energy use of crushing 1 kg of granite in Switzerland.
Location: Data from North America modelled with Swiss and European datasets.
Technology: Typical technology for average Swiss production.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_8394f00e-b021-36ce-9b50-56a635b6ab8d.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
